# Data — everything is regenerable from the pipeline, except the per-AOI
# reports, which are a deliverable of issue #16 and are small markdown.
#
# The old patterns only matched direct children of data/, so once the AOI
# became a parameter and artifacts moved into data/<kind>/<aoi_id>.<ext>,
# every centroid cache, AOI polygon and log would have started being tracked.
data/*
!data/reports/
data/reports/*
!data/reports/*.md

# R
.Rhistory
.RData
.Rproj.user
README.html

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# OS
.DS_Store

# Secrets
.env
*.tfvars
